    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0692" n="632" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg632"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Uhl</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic">June 5,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Proposed bill extends and modifies North Pacific sealing act, 1893, expiring
                    July, 1895, carrying into effect convention between Great Britain and Russia,
                    but is not intended to affect or impair Bering Sea award act, 1894.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
